{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-030",
    "title": "城中最后一夜"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_165",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“由你决定。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "封天令落下后的第一夜，陆照临梦见一场没有尽头的雨。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5245,
          "end": 5245
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "梦里他只有七岁，站在北河城老槐树下。雨水从树冠落下，像无数条透明的线。陆沉舟蹲在他面前，手里握着一盏空灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5247,
          "end": 5247
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三盏灯为什么没有火？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5249,
          "end": 5249
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为火会照见不该照见的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5251,
          "end": 5251
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那它怎么走路？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5253,
          "end": 5253
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灯不走路，拿灯的人走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5255,
          "end": 5255
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只记得他教我修灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5281,
          "end": 5281
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜从洞口回来：“回川城的记忆开始混乱。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5283,
          "end": 5283
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“提前了两天。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5285,
          "end": 5285
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封天令只是延后，不是停止。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5287,
          "end": 5287
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜摊开地图。地图上回川城的位置被青光包围，城中数百盏灯的标记正在互相交换。原本写着“东门”的灯，移动到了城心；原本写着“城心”的灯，则出现在城外。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5289,
          "end": 5289
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有人在改地图。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5291,
          "end": 5291
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是人。”叶观澜回答，“是城里的人开始记错自己住在哪里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5293,
          "end": 5293
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他们赶到回川城时，城门已经半开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5295,
          "end": 5295
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守门老人站在门洞里，手里握着一盏长明灯。他看见陆照临，立刻问：“你是从东门进来的，还是从西门出去的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5297,
          "end": 5297
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我们还没进城。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5299,
          "end": 5299
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老人点头：“那你们已经出去过一次。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5301,
          "end": 5301
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向城内。街道上的行人神情茫然，有人站在自家门前，却认不出门上的字；有人抱着孩子，反复问孩子叫什么。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5303,
          "end": 5303
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记忆错乱已经扩散。”慧闻从城墙上跃下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5305,
          "end": 5305
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你什么时候到的？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5307,
          "end": 5307
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“在你们决定来之前。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5309,
          "end": 5309
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你看见城心了吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5311,
          "end": 5311
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“看见了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5313,
          "end": 5313
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻指向城中最高的钟楼。钟楼上悬着三盏灯，第一盏和第二盏已经点亮，第三盏仍然熄灭。每当钟声响起一次，城里便有一批人忘记自己的住处。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5315,
          "end": 5315
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“必须熄灭前两盏？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5317,
          "end": 5317
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不能。它们是封天令的锚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5319,
          "end": 5319
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就点第三盏。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5321,
          "end": 5321
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“点亮第三盏，城门会完全开启。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5323,
          "end": 5323
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向钟楼：“封天令说三日后开门，为什么现在已经有两盏亮了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5325,
          "end": 5325
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻答：“因为持印者的记忆正在替它倒计时。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5327,
          "end": 5327
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临摸向胸口。半枚残印的青光沿经脉流动，气海里的金色裂纹比昨日更明显。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5329,
          "end": 5329
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我忘了什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5331,
          "end": 5331
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你自己知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5333,
          "end": 5333
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临试着回忆七岁那场雨。槐树、空灯、沈砚秋，他都记得。唯独陆沉舟最后说了什么，始终想不起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5335,
          "end": 5335
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把铜针递给他：“看针尾。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5337,
          "end": 5337
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "针尾缺口朝向城心。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5339,
          "end": 5339
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那里有答案？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5341,
          "end": 5341
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那里有你下一次会失去的东西。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5343,
          "end": 5343
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城内忽然传来哭喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5345,
          "end": 5345
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "一个年轻妇人抱着孩子冲出巷口：“谁把我女儿带走了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5347,
          "end": 5347
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "孩子就在她怀里。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5349,
          "end": 5349
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "妇人低头看了孩子一眼，惊恐地把她推开。孩子摔在地上，哭着喊娘。妇人却后退：“她不是我的孩子。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5351,
          "end": 5351
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临上前扶起孩子。孩子抓住他的袖口：“叔叔，你认识我娘吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5353,
          "end": 5353
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他张口想回答，却突然忘记了“母亲”这个词的含义。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5355,
          "end": 5355
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "胸口残印骤然发热。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5357,
          "end": 5357
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离一把将孩子抱走：“别看她的眼睛。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5359,
          "end": 5359
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻抬起无相铜镜。镜中显示出另一幅画面：妇人抱着孩子走进城心，将孩子的名字交给第一盏灯；灯火熄灭后，她便忘记自己曾经有过孩子。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5361,
          "end": 5361
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是未来，还是已经发生？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5363,
          "end": 5363
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“镜子只照记忆，不照时间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5365,
          "end": 5365
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看向钟楼：“有人在提前执行封天令。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5367,
          "end": 5367
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "钟声再次响起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5369,
          "end": 5369
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城中一半的人同时停下动作。他们看向彼此，像第一次见面。有人拔刀，有人跪地，也有人开始往城门外逃。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5371,
          "end": 5371
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "记忆消失。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-073",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5389,
          "end": 5389
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯在。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-097",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5437,
          "end": 5437
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“够救多少人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5457,
          "end": 5457
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“看你愿意让谁记住自己。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5459,
          "end": 5459
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临回头看城内。顾长离正在街心分发铜针，让居民把针尾缺口对准自己的屋门。叶观澜带着几名归墟盟成员守住东门，阻止玄霄宗的封锁队伍进入。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5461,
          "end": 5461
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们准备怎么做？”慧闻问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5463,
          "end": 5463
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“让人离开。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5465,
          "end": 5465
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“离开城，记忆会在路上崩散。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5467,
          "end": 5467
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“留在城里呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5469,
          "end": 5469
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“成为封天令的锚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5471,
          "end": 5471
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“总要有选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5473,
          "end": 5473
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻把无相铜镜递给他：“镜子可以把一段记忆留在城外，但只能留一段。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5475,
          "end": 5475
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“留谁的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5477,
          "end": 5477
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“由你决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5479,
          "end": 5479
        }
      }
    ],
